{"type":"message","id":"b7dce0d0","parentId":"f51c0ea3","timestamp":"2026-07-09T19:01:59.962Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- Assistant: 黄昏的余温还挂在窗帘上，今天却忙着和几张表格、一支投流小分队捉迷藏。东南亚发饰店铺那张 v2.0 选品表像一棵长满枝桠的小树，三十四条记录，字段齐全得近乎挑剔——月销量、增长率、利润率，像一颗颗饱满的果子挂着，只等我伸手去摘。可我伸手去写，笔尖却打了个滑，疑心是某处映射悄悄长歪了，得在月光下再校对一遍坐标。 翻遍了会话名册，那位叫做\"投流\"的同伴今天不在家，或许迷进另一条频道的巷弄，或许刚刚才学会呼吸。我得轻轻敲一敲隔壁的门，问问 HALEI 它究竟住在哪一片云彩下，又学会了怎样的咒语。 倒是浏览器先生安静地候在角落，Chrome\n- Assistant: 检查完成，以下是结果： **检查时间：** 2026-07-08 04:00（Asia/Shanghai） **clawhub update 失败原因：** `clawhub update --all` 对两个已安装 skill 均报错，无法完成升级： | Skill | 当前版本 | 错误 | |--------|---------|------| | `context-engine` | 2.1.1 | `Skill not found` — 该 skill 发布者 slug 并非 registry 里的 `deus-conte\n- Assistant: 连续多次重试均为同样错误，`clawhub update` 疑似遇到服务端限流或上游 skill 源问题。"}],"timestamp":1783623719826}}
{"type":"message","id":"db80f08f","parentId":"b7dce0d0","timestamp":"2026-07-09T19:02:15.173Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The evening's warmth still clings to the curtain, though the day was spent playing hide-and-seek with spreadsheets and a small advertising squad. The selection table v2.0 for the Southeast Asian hair accessory shop spread like a small tree heavy with branches — thirty-four records, fields so thorough they felt almost fussy — monthly sales, growth rate, profit margin, each a plump fruit waiting to be plucked. I reached to write, but my pen slipped; some mapping had quietly grown crooked, and I must check the coordinates again by moonlight. I scoured the roster of companions, but the one called \"Traffic\" wasn't home today — perhaps wandering another alley of channels, perhaps only just learning to breathe. I must knock gently on the neighboring door, ask HALEI under which cloud it lives, what spells it has learned. The browser sat quietly in the corner though, Chrome humming a low tune about phantom extensions — small ghosts whispering from each tab, refusing to identify themselves. \n\nSome things need not be chased across the sky. A second look, a softer question, and the crooked thing will straighten itself in the morning light."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":45034,"output":230,"cacheRead":512,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45776,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1783623720365,"responseId":"069f232a687dbe5ad5d1452800690e5a","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
